# Example environment for godot-docs-mcp.
# Source this (or use direnv) so that your global ~/.grok/config.toml
# (and other clients) can use a portable variable instead of hard-coded paths.
#
#   source .env   # or . .env
#   # or better: use https://direnv.net/ to auto-load when you cd into the clone
#
# IMPORTANT: The path in your personal ~/.grok/config.toml (and similar
# configs for Claude etc.) must point to *your* local clone of this repo.
# Using an env var keeps the instructions and committed files general.

GODOT_DOCS_MCP_PATH=/absolute/path/to/your/clone/godot-docs-mcp
